{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106290","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1910629001:0":{"text":"关于“母神”的心愿、心愿记录的年代断层、海裔对神明的无...","source_cn":"关于“母神”的心愿、心愿记录的年代断层、海裔对神明的无...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1910629002:0":{"text":"你沉下心来……","source_cn":"你沉下心来……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x80E0F41A1BDC288E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910629003:1":{"text":"但整件事仍疑点重重……你陷入沉思。在漫长的时光之前，浅...","source_cn":"但整件事仍疑点重重……你陷入沉思。在漫长的时光之前，浅...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910629004:1":{"text":"除了他，其余的海裔均在灾难中灭亡，母神的信仰也由此丧失...","source_cn":"除了他，其余的海裔均在灾难中灭亡，母神的信仰也由此丧失...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910629005:1":{"text":"然后他们因故消失，新的成员再次迁徙至此，反复以往，周而...","source_cn":"然后他们因故消失，新的成员再次迁徙至此，反复以往，周而...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_t